{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":false,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":360,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2n"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":false,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"timeBak":300,"x":360,"bright":1,"transTime":0,"y":-180,"nonStandBright":false,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2n"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]你问我为何会选择双刀作为武器？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]嗯——为什么呢……我在过去拾荒的时候也尝试过各种各样的武器，整体来说我并不喜欢太笨重的武器。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]并不是不会用，只是感觉那种武器用起来完全不合我的性格。相比起来，两把匕首让我更能随心所欲地用上身体动作。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]更重要的是，轻便的武器维护起来也更简单，省下来的时间可以用来睡懒觉，也方便应对更紧急的状况。这也算是荒野生存的小技巧，懂了吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"script":"yd_002_07-备份","des":"米托拉-米托拉的战斗风格"}